    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned enterprise responsible for the management and operation of power systems in China. It establishes regulations for production technology renovation and equipment overhaul project acceptance to ensure safety, quality, and proper commissioning of engineering projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department is the central management department responsible for overseeing production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects. It formulates acceptance regulations, supervises implementation, and conducts inspections and evaluations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Safety and Quality Department is responsible for safety and quality management within the company's project execution, including participation in project acceptance processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信通部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Information and Communication Department manages information and communication aspects of projects and participates in relevant project acceptance activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department oversees material procurement, equipment supervision, and factory acceptance, providing technical documentation and supporting inspection processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Dispatch Control Center is responsible for organizing and participating in project acceptance related to dispatch and control systems, especially for directly maintained assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Finance Department participates in project completion acceptance and supports the confirmation of equipment transfer lists and financial documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司总部相关部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Company headquarters departments include specialized units such as Safety, Information & Communication, Materials, and Dispatch Control, each responsible for specific aspects of project acceptance based on their professional functions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial-level Unit Safety and Quality Department acts as the local regulatory body for technology renovation and overhaul projects, ensuring compliance with company rules and managing acceptance procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial Dispatch Sub-center organizes and coordinates project acceptance for assets directly maintained at the provincial level, following professional division of labor.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial Finance Department participates in project completion acceptance and assists in confirming equipment transfer documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Unit-level Operation and Maintenance Departments are responsible for managing technology renovation and overhaul projects at their respective levels, organizing acceptance, and conducting oversight.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位相关部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Unit-level departments such as Safety, Information & Communication, Materials, and Dispatch are tasked with organizing or supporting project acceptance activities based on their functional roles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位所属单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subordinate unit Operation and Maintenance Departments manage lower-level projects (limited-down projects) and conduct acceptance activities for assets under their maintenance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位所属单位其它部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Other departments within subordinate units assist in project acceptance by coordinating across safety, information, materials, and dispatch functions, and supporting financial verification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects refer to infrastructure improvement and equipment maintenance initiatives managed under the National Grid Company’s framework, subject to strict acceptance procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"阶段性验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Phase-based acceptance refers to intermediate inspection stages during project execution, including equipment supervision, concealed works inspection, main equipment disassembly checks, and sampling tests.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Final acceptance is the comprehensive inspection conducted after full installation and commissioning of a project, ensuring all requirements are met before official handover and operation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Self-inspection is the initial internal review performed by the implementing team or contractor after project completion, prior to formal application for final acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新增资产清点\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"New asset inventory involves verifying physical assets against documented records before final acceptance, ensuring accuracy in equipment transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目竣工移交\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project completion handover includes ensuring equipment is defect-free, documentation is complete, and all operational and safety requirements are satisfied before commissioning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"验收资料归档\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Acceptance documentation archiving involves preserving key records such as test reports, change logs, inspection reports, and approval forms for future reference and audit.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"检查考核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Inspection and evaluation involve monitoring and assessing the effectiveness of project acceptance practices, identifying issues, and enforcing corrective actions through feedback and reporting.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department is designated by the National Grid Company to oversee and manage the implementation of project acceptance regulations.\"<|>\"regulatory authority, organizational hierarchy\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"公司总部相关部门\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department collaborates with other headquarters departments (e.g., Safety, Materials, Finance) in managing and supervising project acceptance.\"<|>\"interdepartmental coordination, shared responsibility\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation and Maintenance Department provides guidance and oversight to provincial-level safety and quality departments in executing project acceptance.\"<|>\"supervision, hierarchical management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"调控分中心\"<|>\"The Provincial Safety and Quality Department and Dispatch Sub-center work together in organizing project acceptance for assets under direct provincial maintenance.\"<|>\"professional collaboration, project execution\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各单位运检部门\"<|>\"各单位相关部门\"<|>\"Unit-level Operation and Maintenance Departments coordinate with other functional departments (e.g., Finance, Materials, Dispatch) to carry out acceptance tasks.\"<|>\"cross-functional cooperation, operational integration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各单位所属单位运检部门\"<|>\"各单位所属单位其它部门\"<|>\"Subordinate unit Operation and Maintenance Departments collaborate with other departments in conducting acceptance for lower-level projects.\"<|>\"team coordination, task delegation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"阶段性验收\"<|>\"Phase-based acceptance is a required step within the lifecycle of production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects.\"<|>\"project phase, procedural requirement\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"Final acceptance is the concluding stage of the project lifecycle, confirming readiness for commissioning.\"<|>\"project conclusion, quality assurance\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"自验收\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"Self-inspection must be completed before a formal application for final acceptance can be submitted.\"<|>\"preliminary assessment, prerequisite pr