ementation projects into the annual plan and budget after company sign-off.\"<|>\"project governance, regulatory authority\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"项目管理队伍建设\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department mandates that divisions and units strengthen their project management teams by hiring qualified professionals and organizing training.\"<|>\"team development, capacity building\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"信息化手段实现项目全过程管控\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department encourages the use of digital tools to achieve full-cycle project control and improve management quality.\"<|>\"digital transformation, process optimization\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司应急物资管理要求\"<|>\"物资调用或紧急采购\"<|>\"Units must follow the company’s emergency material management rules when executing material mobilization or urgent procurement.\"<|>\"emergency procedures, procurement compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"框架协议中标单位\"<|>\"服务采购\"<|>\"Service procurement may prioritize framework agreement winners, indicating a preference based on pre-qualified suppliers.\"<|>\"procurement strategy, supplier selection\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"加快实施项目\"<|>\"物资优先使用库存储备和调拨物资\"<|>\"For accelerated implementation projects, inventory and allocated materials are prioritized before resorting to new procurement.\"<|>\"resource allocation, supply chain efficiency\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"加快实施项目\"<|>\"服务采购优先采用框架协议\"<|>\"In accelerated projects, services are first sourced from existing framework agreements to expedite execution.\"<|>\"contractual procurement, efficiency\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年7月10日\"<|>\"本规定自2020年7月10日起施行\"<|>\"The regulation became effective on July 10, 2020, replacing the previous version.\"<|>\"regulatory timeline, legal enforcement\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"原《国家电网公司生产设备大修工作管理规定》\"<|>\"本规定\"<|>\"The current regulation supersedes and repeals the earlier 'State Grid Corporation's Equipment Overhaul Work Management Regulations' issued in 2014.\"<|>\"regulation replacement, legal succession\"<|>10)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project management, emergency procurement, equipment overhaul, regulatory compliance, digital control, organizational oversight\")<|COMPLETE|>"
