rrective measures, and verification results.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"缺陷处理报告\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Defect handling reports are formal documents detailing issues found in equipment or systems, along with the steps taken to resolve them. These reports must include complete records such as analysis, action plans, outcomes, and re-inspection findings.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电子文件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electronic files refer to digital versions of project documents that must comply with specific standards for format, metadata, storage, and long-term accessibility. They are subject to strict archival rules under national and corporate regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"只读光盘\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Read-only optical discs are specified as an acceptable storage medium for electronic archives. They are used to preserve digital files in a tamper-resistant format to ensure integrity and durability.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"硬磁盘\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Hard disks are another approved physical carrier for electronic files in archival storage. Like optical media, they must be labeled with key information including serial number, file code, retention period, confidentiality level, and date of entry.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"卷内备考表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The case internal preparation sheet is a document placed within each archival folder to record details about the contents, such as omissions, discrepancies, or notes on handling. It ensures transparency and completeness of the archive.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"纸质案卷封面\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Paper case cover is the outer label or cover of a physical archive folder. It must be properly formatted and filled out according to company standards to identify the project and its contents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"卷内目录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Internal table of contents is a list inside each archival folder that outlines all documents included in that volume. It enables efficient retrieval and cross-referencing of materials.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"签字盖章手续完备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Complete signature and stamp procedures refer to the requirement that official documents must bear valid signatures and seals from relevant parties to confirm authenticity and legal validity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"耐久性要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Durability requirements specify that writing materials used in archival documents must withstand long-term storage without fading or degradation, ensuring readability over time.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目前期管理\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Documents generated during project preliminary management are part of the complete set of files required for project archival purposes.\"|>\"document generation, archival inclusion\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目计划预算管理\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"All financial planning and budgeting documents are mandatory components of the project archive.\"|>\"financial documentation, archival compliance\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Records created during project execution, including progress reports and technical logs, must be archived as part of the full lifecycle.\"|>\"execution documentation, archiving obligation\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目结（决）算管理\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Settlement and final accounting documents are essential elements of the project archive, ensuring fiscal accountability.\"|>\"financial closure, archival completeness\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"附件：生产技术改造和设备大修项目档案管理归档范围目录表\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"This catalog serves as a reference for determining which documents should be included in the project archive, guiding proper classification and filing.\"|>\"archival guidance, scope definition\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计变更\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Design change records are required to be retained in the archive to maintain traceability and support future audits or reviews.\"|>\"change management, documentation retention\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工质量处理\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Quality correction records must be archived to ensure quality assurance and accountability throughout the project lifecycle.\"|>\"quality control, audit trail\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"缺陷处理报告\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Defect resolution reports are critical parts of the archive, providing evidence of issue resolution and system reliability.\"|>\"defect resolution, quality assurance\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电子文件\"<|>\"电子文件整理\"<|>\"Electronic files must be processed according to specific guidelines during the organizing phase, including metadata recording and carrier labeling.\"|>\"digital processing, standard compliance\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"只读光盘\"<|>\"电子文件\"<|>\"Read-only optical discs are designated as a secure and durable medium for storing electronic files in archival systems.\"|>\"storage medium, data preservation\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"硬磁盘\"<|>\"电子文件\"<|>\"Hard disks are approved physical carriers for electronic files and must be labeled with key archival metadata.\"|>\"storage medium, metadata tagging\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"卷内备考表\"<|>\"纸质案卷封面\"<|>\"Both the internal preparation sheet and the paper case cover are integral parts of the physical archive structure, working together to ensure clarity and completeness.\"|>\"archive organization, structural components\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"卷内目录\"<|>\"卷内备考表\"<|>\"The internal table of contents and the preparation sheet are both located within the same archival folder and serve complementary roles in managing content.\"|>\"internal documentation, coordination\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"签字盖章手续完备\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"All documents in the archive must have complete signature and seal procedures to validate their authenticity and legal status.\"|>\"document validation, legal compliance\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"耐久性要求\"<|>\"项目档案\"<|>\"Writing materials used in project archive documents must meet durability standards to ensure long-term legibility and preservation.\"|>\"material standardization, longevity\"|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project lifecycle phases, archival documentation, electronic file 