    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned enterprise responsible for power grid operations and management in China. It establishes regulations for production technology renovation and equipment overhaul project acceptance to ensure safe and high-quality project commissioning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation & Inspection Department is the central management department responsible for overseeing production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, including formulating acceptance regulations, supervising implementation, and conducting inspections.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Safety and Quality Department is responsible for organizing and supervising safety-related aspects of project acceptance within headquarters assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信通部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Information and Communication Department manages information and communication system integration and related project acceptance activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department oversees equipment supervision, factory acceptance, and provides related technical documentation for project acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Control Center is responsible for organizing and coordinating project acceptance for directly maintained assets, particularly in power system control and scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Finance Department participates in project acceptance, especially in confirming asset transfer registers and financial documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary Unit Safety and Quality Office serves as the local oversight body for technical renovation and overhaul projects within its jurisdiction, implementing company-wide rules and managing local project acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary Unit Dispatching Sub-center organizes and conducts acceptance for assets directly maintained under its unit, with coordination responsibilities across specialties.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary Unit Finance Office participates in project acceptance for directly maintained assets and assists in verifying equipment transfer records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Local Operation & Maintenance Departments are responsible for organizing and supervising project acceptance at their level, including for entrusted maintenance assets above specified thresholds.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位相关部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Local Departmental Units (e.g., safety, information, materials, dispatch) are tasked with organizing or supporting acceptance activities for specific asset types and projects based on professional division of labor.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位所属单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subordinate Unit Operation & Maintenance Departments manage acceptance for lower-tier projects (below threshold) within their operational scope.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位所属单位其它部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subordinate Unit Other Departments (e.g., safety, materials, dispatch, finance) assist in conducting acceptance for routine projects and support asset verification processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Project Unit refers to the entity responsible for organizing project implementation and execution, typically the asset operation and maintenance unit or department that carries out the project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Construction Unit is the contractor responsible for executing the project work, including self-inspection, submitting documents, and completing defect rectifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Supervision Unit is responsible for monitoring project quality and compliance, providing reports, and participating in all stages of acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Design Unit prepares design summary reports, explains changes, and confirms implementation of anti-accident measures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"阶段性验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Phase-based Acceptance refers to interim inspection processes including equipment supervision, hidden works inspection, main equipment disassembly checks, and sampling tests during construction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Final Acceptance is the comprehensive evaluation conducted after full installation and commissioning, ensuring all requirements are met before project handover.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备监造及出厂验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Equipment Supervision and Factory Acceptance involves monitoring equipment manufacturing and verifying quality prior to shipment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"隐蔽性工程验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Hidden Works Acceptance occurs when construction is concealed, requiring inspection before covering, with documentation and imaging required.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主设备解体检查验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Main Equipment Disassembly Inspection involves checking large transformers (110kV and above) before installation to ensure integrity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"交接试验项目抽样检查验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Sampling Inspection of Handover Test Projects requires testing at different voltage levels and equipment categories, with a minimum 10% sample rate and retesting if failures occur.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Self-acceptance is the initial internal review conducted by the implementing team or construction unit after project completion.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新增资产清点\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"New Asset Inventory involves verifying physical assets against the transfer register before final acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目竣工移交\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project Final Handover ensures all conditions are met for commissioning, including documentation completeness, asset alignment, safety compliance, and operational readiness.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"验收资料归档\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Acceptance Documentation Archiving requires retention of all relevant records such as test reports, change logs, and acceptance forms within specified timeframes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"检查考核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Inspection and Evaluation involves reviewing the effectiveness of acceptance processes, identifying issues, enforcing corrective actions, and promoting closed-loop management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2014年8月1日\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"August 1, 2014, is the effective date of the regulation, marking the start of its implementation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网生〔2010〕1761号\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A former official document number (State Grid Production [2010] No. 1761) that was repealed upon the issuance of this new regulation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation & Inspection Department is designated by National Grid Company as the central authority responsible for developing and overseeing project acceptance regulations.\"<|>\"regulatory authority, organizational hierarchy\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation & Inspection Department oversees and guides regional safety and quality offices in executing project acceptance duties.\"<|>\"supervisory relationship, standardization\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"各层级单位运检部门\"<|>\"The State Grid Operation & Inspection Department sets standards and policies that all local Operation & Maintenance Departments must follow.\"<|>\"policy enforcement, hierarchical compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"The Project Unit receives the construction work and verifies the construction unit’s self-acceptance before initiating formal acceptance.\"<|>\"contractual responsibility, quality assurance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"The Project Unit collaborates with the Supervision Unit to verify compliance and inspect project quality throughout all acceptance stages