    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company is a major state-owned enterprise responsible for power grid operations and management in China. It establishes regulations for production technology renovation and equipment overhaul project acceptance to ensure safe and high-quality project commissioning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Operation & Inspection Department is the central management department responsible for overseeing production technology renovation and equipment overhaul projects, including formulating acceptance regulations, supervising implementation, and conducting inspections.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Safety and Quality Department is responsible for organizing and supervising safety-related aspects of project acceptance within headquarters assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信通部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Information and Communication Department manages information and communication system integration and related project acceptance activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department oversees equipment supervision, factory acceptance, and provides related technical documentation for project acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Control Center is responsible for organizing and coordinating project acceptance for directly maintained assets, particularly in power system control and scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Finance Department participates in project acceptance, especially in confirming asset transfer registers and financial documentation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部安质处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary Unit Safety and Quality Office serves as the local oversight body for technical renovation and overhaul projects within its jurisdiction, implementing company-wide rules and managing local project acceptance.\")##\n(