arsh safety conditions are one of the reasons why project supervision is required.\"|>\"risk-based supervision, safety trigger\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工技术难度高\"<|>\"项目监理\"<|>\"High technical difficulty increases the need for supervision to ensure quality and safety.\"|>\"complexity-driven oversight, technical risk\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设备材料价格波动\"<|>\"重新履行可研审批程序\"<|>\"Price fluctuations are explicitly excluded as a reason for requiring re-approval of feasibility studies.\"|>\"exception clause, cost adjustment exclusion\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"原设计方案变化\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Any change to the original design triggers the need for preliminary design, especially if it involves major modifications.\"|>\"design trigger, modification requirement\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"土建工程\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Civil engineering works such as tunnel repair or structural stabilization require preliminary design due to complexity.\"|>\"construction complexity, design necessity\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计单位资质\"<|>\"初步设计审查\"<|>\"Only qualified design units can prepare documents for review and approval during preliminary design.\"|>\"qualification prerequisite, review gate\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可研规模和估算\"<|>\"初步设计审查\"<|>\"Preliminary design must not exceed the approved feasibility study scale and estimate unless special exceptions apply.\"|>\"budget constraint, scope control\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"重大变化\"<|>\"重新履行可研审批程序\"<|>\"Major changes exceeding thresholds require re-submission of feasibility study approval.\"|>\"change control, procedural revalidation\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"资金重大调整\"<|>\"重新履行可研审批程序\"<|>\"Substantial financial changes due to design revisions necessitate re-approval of feasibility studies.\"|>\"financial impact, approval re-trigger\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"签章材料\"<|>\"Emergency projects are initiated only after receiving officially signed and stamped documents from relevant authorities.\"|>\"authorization requirement, documentation proof\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家及行业法规、标准和规程\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Final project acceptance must comply with national and industry regulations, standards, and procedures.\"|>\"compliance basis, legal framework\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"受托运维单位\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"The entrusted operation and maintenance unit typically organizes the final acceptance for the assets it manages.\"|>\"responsibility assignment, acceptance lead\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"委托单位\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"The entrusting unit may choose to organize or designate the final acceptance for specific projects.\"|>\"oversight authority, discretionary role\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目开竣工报告\"<|>\"项目施工方案\"<|>\"Start and completion reports include details about the construction plan and its execution.\"|>\"documentation integration, timeline tracking\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"安全、技术、组织措施\"<|>\"项目施工方案\"<|>\"The construction plan incorporates safety, technical, and organizational measures to guide execution.\"|>\"planning integration, implementation guidance\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目监理、施工、验收记录\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"These records are essential inputs for the final acceptance process, verifying compliance.\"|>\"evidence submission, verification basis\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计变更、合同变更、签证变更\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"All change documents must be reviewed and documented before final acceptance.\"|>\"change management, documentation requirement\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"占地及赔偿协议\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Land acquisition and compensation agreements are part of the documentation required for project closure.\"|>\"legal documentation, asset clearance\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"收付款证明\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Payment proofs are necessary to confirm financial settlements tied to project completion.\"|>\"financial verification, closure requirement\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工单位安装、调试和启动测试资料\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Test records confirm operational readiness and are required for acceptance.\"|>\"functional verification, operational proof\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目竣工图\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Final drawings must reflect actual changes and are submitted as part of the acceptance package.\"|>\"as-built documentation, accuracy requirement\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目结算报告\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Settlement reports are prepared after acceptance and are submitted for financial processing.\"|>\"post-acceptance reporting, financial closure\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"审计相关资料\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Audit documents are generated post-acceptance to verify financial integrity.\"|>\"compliance follow-up, financial audit\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"一项目一档案\"<|>\"档案目录\"<|>\"Each project requires its own unique archival directory to organize documentation.\"|>\"individual recordkeeping, system structure\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可研报告及批复文件\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Feasibility study documents are prerequisites for project plan issuance.\"|>\"precondition, planning foundation\"|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目初步设计及批复文件，施工图设计及审查文件\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Design documents must be approved before the project plan is finalized and issued.\"|>\"design approval, planning dependency\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"中标通知书和合同文件\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Procurement documents are part of the overall project authorization process.\"|>\"contractual basis, implementation preparation\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"工程设计文件\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Design documents are integral to the formal issuance of project plans.\"|>\"technical foundation, planning input\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"监理报告\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Supervision reports are not directly linked to plan issuance but are part of ongoing monitoring.\"|>\"monitoring output, post-issuance activity\"|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"竣工验收申请\"<|>\"项目计划下达文件\"<|>\"Acceptance applications are submitted after plan implementation, not before.\"|>\"post-implementation step, sequential order\"|>5)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"材料出厂试验报告\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\