r plans into the broader organizational planning framework and leads project feasibility assessments and approvals.\" <|>\"planning integration, project governance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司西南分部\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"The Finance and Asset Department manages the budgeting, funding, and financial reporting for all technology renovation and major repair projects under the Southwest Branch.\" <|>\"financial oversight, budget control\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司西南分部\"<|>\"西南审计中心\"<|>\"The Southwest Audit Center conducts audits on major projects and entrusted assets managed by the Southwest Branch, ensuring accountability and compliance.\" <|>\"audit function, financial control\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司西南分部\"<|>\"安全监察部\"<|>\"The Safety Supervision Department monitors safety and quality performance during project execution and assists in validating emergency project status.\" <|>\"safety supervision, risk management\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司西南分部\"<|>\"调度控制中心\"<|>\"The Dispatch Control Center coordinates power outage schedules and manages professional project execution for directly operated assets.\" <|>\"operational coordination, project execution\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"受托运维省公司\"<|>\"省公司所属超高压公司\"<|>\"The provincial company's extra-high voltage company acts as the executing entity responsible for implementing technology renovation and major repair projects on assets it operates under delegation.\" <|>\"delegation of responsibility, execution chain\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省公司所属超高压公司\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"The extra-high voltage company collaborates with the Production Technology Department in preparing project requirements, feasibility studies, and participating in review processes.\" <|>\"project collaboration, implementation support\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国家电网公司西南分部\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation of China sets overarching policies, regulations, and standards that guide the Southwest Branch in