es, manages annual plans and budgets, and oversees project execution across all levels, including emergency projects, business expansion supporting grid renovation packages, and designated fast-track projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目监理目录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Project Supervision Directory is a list specifying work content that triggers the requirement for project supervision when associated with projects exceeding 25,000 RMB in supervision fees.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Emergency projects are those initiated under urgent circumstances, recognized by official stamped documentation, allowed to be implemented first before reporting to headquarters for filing, and later integrated into annual plans and budget adjustments after feasibility approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Business expansion supporting grid renovation project packages allow units to establish sub-projects within their investment limits, which can be implemented upon obtaining review opinions and are subject to centralized feasibility approvals and plan issuance annually.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Company-designated fast-track projects require formal approval via company sign-off and must be included in annual plans and budgets; priority is given to using existing inventory and framework agreements for procurement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project completion acceptance is conducted based on national and industry regulations, standards, design documents, supervision reports, and application for acceptance. For entrusted operation and maintenance assets, the operation and maintenance unit typically organizes the acceptance, though the entrusting party may also organize it depending on circumstances.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算与决算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project settlement and final accounting involve the review of reports from design, supervision, construction, and commissioning parties after acceptance, leading to the preparation of a settlement report within 60 days, followed by the compilation of a final accounting report by the finance department.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目拆旧管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project dismantling management includes assessing equipment for removal during the feasibility stage, proposing reuse or scrapping recommendations, and organizing the physical removal and handover to the material management department during implementation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"档案管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Archival management follows the principle of 'who manages, who is responsible, who generates, who organizes' and requires completion of archiving within three months after project commissioning, with records organized per project and including documents such as feasibility reports, design files, contracts, change orders, and final drawings.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目造价分析\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project cost analysis focuses on completed projects with settled accounts, analyzing cost trends and funding utilization to guide estimation and improve investment management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目后评价\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Post-evaluation of projects occurs after a certain period post-commissioning, using targeted models to assess management risks and provide improvement recommendations for precise and lean investment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信息系统查询\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Information system query is one of the methods used by State Grid Equipment Department for mid-process monitoring and post-completion inspection of project management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"现场督查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Field inspection is a method employed by State Grid Equipment Department to supervise and evaluate project execution and performance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2020年7月10日\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"The date from which this regulation came into effect, marking the official implementation of the new guidelines replacing the previous 2014 version.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司生产技术改造工作管理规定\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The former regulation, issued in 2014 (Document No. Guodian Qiguan [2014] 69), was repealed upon the implementation of this new regulation.\")##\n\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"Project units must oversee supervision units in controlling safety, quality, progress, and cost, and are responsible for evaluating and assessing their performance.\"|>\"oversight, compliance, project control\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"财务部门\"<|>\"Project units must submit asset transfer notices and project settlement reports to the finance department after project completion for further processing.\"|>\"financial reporting, asset transfer\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"Project units coordinate with the material management department during the dismantling phase to hand over removed equipment for subsequent storage and disposal.\"|>\"equipment handover, asset management\"|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"Project units are subject to supervision and evaluation by State Grid Equipment Department through information systems and field inspections, which may lead to interviews, notifications, or performance assessments.\"|>\"regulatory oversight, compliance monitoring\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"State Grid Equipment Department conducts supervision and evaluation activities that impact divisions, requiring them to strengthen team building and adopt information-based project management.\"|>\"supervisory authority, organizational accountability\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Divisions are responsible for ensuring that project units have sufficient professional staff and provide training, directly influencing project management quality.\"|>\"management support, workforce development\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目监理目录\"<|>\"Projects must meet conditions listed in the Project Supervision Directory to trigger mandatory supervision, particularly when supervision costs reach or exceed 25,000 RMB.\"|>\"compliance requirement, threshold trigger\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"公司\"<|>\"Emergency projects can be implemented immediately but must be reported to headquarters and integrated into the company’s annual plan and budget after feasibility approval.\"|>\"emergency authorization, integration into planning\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"公司\"<|>\"The project package operates within the company’s investment limits and requires annual updates to its overall plan and budget.\"|>\"budget allocation, project packaging\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"公司\"<|>\"Fast-track projects require formal approval from the company and are incorporated into annual plans and budgets accordingly.\"|>\"executive approval, accelerated implementation\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"The supervision unit provides a supervision report used as a key document in the project completion acceptance process.\"|>\"documentation, verification basis\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目结算与决算\"<|>\"财务部门\"<|>\"The finance department compiles the final project settlement report after receiving the settlement report from the project unit.\"|>\"financial reporting, final accounting\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目拆旧管理\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"After the project implementation phase, the materials management department takes responsibility for storing and disposing of dismantled equipment.\"|>\"asset lifecycle, handover process\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"档案管理\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for organizing and completing archival work in accordance with the 'one project, one file' principle and submitting complete records to the archive management department.\"|>\"recordkeeping, compliance with standards\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目造价分析\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Project units contribute data and reports necessary for cost analysis, which helps inform future estimation and budgeting processes.\"|>\"data provision, financial analysis\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目后评价\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Project units participate in post-evaluation activities by providing relevant operational data and supporting documentation for risk assessment and improvement planning.\"|>\"performance evaluation, feedback loop\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"信息系统查询\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"State Grid Equipment Department uses information system queries as a primary tool for monitoring project execution and identifying management deficiencies.\"|>\"digital oversight, real-time monitoring\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"现场督查\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"Field inspections conducted by State Grid Equipment Department serve as direct means of verifying compliance and identifying issues in project management practices.\"|>\"on-site verification, enforcement\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年7月10日\"<|>\"国家电网公司生产技术改造工作管理规定\"<|>\"The new regulation became effective on July 10, 2020, and formally replaced the previous 2014 version.\"|>\"regulatory replacement, timeline alignment\"|>10)##\n\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project management, supervision, financial control, asset disposal, archival management, cost analysis, post-evaluation, regulatory compliance, emergency projects, infrastructure renovation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
