    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Grid production technology renovation refers to the modernization and upgrading of power grid infrastructure, including technical upgrades and equipment maintenance, governed by planning and management procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产设备大修\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Equipment major overhaul involves significant repair or replacement of power generation and distribution equipment, with specific thresholds for project size and complexity requiring formal documentation and approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department is responsible for managing and overseeing grid production technology renovation and equipment major overhaul projects, including project review, implementation supervision, and preliminary design approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department manages project reserves, comprehensive planning, budgeting, and decision-making processes, including the review and approval of project plans and adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Finance and Asset Department handles financial planning, budget allocation, and fiscal oversight related to project funding and adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省公司设备管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The provincial company's equipment management department oversees the implementation and review of asset maintenance projects delegated by the division, particularly for assets not directly managed by the division.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Extra-high Voltage Company (or other municipal-level units) is responsible for the actual implementation of projects involving assets delegated by the division, particularly in high-voltage transmission systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The project unit is the entity responsible for initiating project needs, preparing feasibility studies, and managing project execution based on operational requirements and technical standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The project reserve pool is a centralized database maintained by the Development Planning Department, containing approved projects that have completed feasibility reviews and are ready for inclusion in annual plans and budgets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Limit-up projects refer to large-scale initiatives exceeding specified investment thresholds that require higher-level approval and follow strict governance procedures, including corporate headquarters review.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Limit-down projects are smaller-scale initiatives within defined budget limits, managed through decentralized decision-making processes at the division level.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可研报告\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Feasibility study report is a detailed document required for major projects, assessing technical, economic, and operational viability, prepared by qualified entities and subject to formal review.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目建议书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Project proposal is a simplified document used for smaller projects that do not require full feasibility studies, prepared by the project unit and subject to basic review.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"里程碑计划\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Milestone plan is a structured timeline outlining key stages and deliverables in a project’s lifecycle, monitored monthly and used for performance tracking.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"招投标管理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Bidding and tendering management ensures all procurement activities comply with regulations, promoting transparency, competition, and efficiency in acquiring goods and services.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Preliminary design is an advanced phase of project planning involving detailed engineering work, required for complex or high-investment projects, and subject to formal review and approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"外包\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Outsourcing refers to the practice of contracting project execution to external parties, requiring the establishment of an owner project team to manage responsibilities and ensure control.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自主实施\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Self-implemented projects are those carried out internally by the project unit, requiring internal team formation and clear assignment of roles for safety, quality, and execution.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department oversees the planning, review, and implementation of grid production technology renovation projects.\"|>\"project management, oversight\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"生产设备大修\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department manages the entire lifecycle of equipment major overhaul projects, including review and approval.\"|>\"project management, oversight\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department establishes and maintains the project reserve pool, ensuring projects are properly evaluated and ranked before inclusion.\"|>\"project repository, planning oversight\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department is involved in the initial review and final approval of limit-up projects, which are escalated to corporate headquarters.\"|>\"high-level project governance\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department manages the approval and disbursement of limit-down project details within allocated budgets.\"|>\"budget allocation, project execution\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"预算管理\"<|>\"The Finance and Asset Department plays a central role in budget formulation, allocation, and adjustment across all project categories.\"|>\"financial planning, budget control\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省公司设备管理部门\"<|>\"分部委托运维资产项目\"<|>\"The provincial equipment management department is responsible for overseeing and reviewing projects involving assets delegated by the division.\"|>\"asset management, delegation oversight\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"分部委托运维资产项目\"<|>\"The Extra-high Voltage Company executes the actual work on projects involving assets delegated by the division.\"|>\"project execution, implementation\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目需求管理\"<|>\"The project unit initiates and manages project requests based on equipment status and professional needs, forming the basis for feasibility studies.\"|>\"project initiation, demand input\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"可研报告\"<|>\"The project unit prepares or commissions the preparation of feasibility reports for qualifying projects, ensuring alignment with technical and financial criteria.\"|>\"feasibility study, documentation\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department conducts the review and approval of preliminary designs for direct-operations assets, ensuring technical compliance.\"|>\"design review, technical oversight\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department coordinates the release of annual project plans and budget allocations, ensuring alignment with strategic goals.\"|>\"planning execution, budget distribution\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"项目可研审批\"<|>\"Projects must obtain a feasibility study review before being admitted into the reserve library, linking planning and approval stages.\"|>\"project readiness, approval gateway\"|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可研报告\"<|>\"可行性研究内容深度规定\"<|>\"The content of the feasibility report must meet the depth requirements specified in the official guidelines to ensure completeness and compliance.\"|>\"regulatory compliance, documentation standard\"|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目里程碑计划\"<|>\"月度执行通报\"<|>\"Monthly progress reports on milestone plans are submitted and publicly shared to monitor performance and maintain accountability.\"|>\"performance tracking, reporting\"|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"招投标管理\"<|>\"采购周期\"<|>\"Procurement timelines are factored into bidding and tendering processes to ensure timely delivery and project continuity.\"|>\"procurement efficiency, scheduling integration\"|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project management, feasibility study, budgeting, asset maintenance, planning and implementation, regulatory compliance, project lifecycle\")<|COMPLETE|>"
