    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A five-year cycle planning framework for power grid production technology upgrades, aligned with transmission and distribution pricing review cycles and integrated into company-wide planning management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司规划\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The overarching corporate planning system that integrates and manages grid production technology renovation planning across all levels of the organization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"总部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The central management body responsible for organizing reviews and approvals of upper-limit projects and setting overall control targets for project plans and budgets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regional divisions under the company that manage and approve lower-limit projects, organize project reviews, and handle budget decompositions within their jurisdictions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary units or local branches responsible for compiling annual plans and budget proposals, managing project reserves, and executing project approvals within their scope.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Asset operation and maintenance units or departments responsible for proposing project demands, preparing feasibility studies, and implementing projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Feasibility study or project proposal document required for project initiation, including cost estimates and technical assessments, mandatory for projects above 200 million RMB.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"High-value projects requiring centralized review and approval by headquarters, with detailed procedures for evaluation and authorization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Lower-value projects managed and approved by regional divisions or individual units based on asset ownership and jurisdiction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A dynamic repository of pre-approved projects derived from demand, requiring feasibility study review and meeting quality and priority assessment criteria before inclusion.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家、地方、公司政策\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulatory and strategic guidelines at national, regional, and organizational levels that may necessitate mid-term adjustments or termination of equipment renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网事故\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Unexpected incidents in the power grid that trigger emergency implementation of equipment upgrades or repairs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"救灾抢修\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Emergency restoration activities following natural disasters or crises, requiring urgent execution of technical renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"迎峰度夏（冬）需求\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Seasonal peak electricity demand periods during summer and winter, influencing investment planning and project scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资采购周期\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The time required to procure materials and services, a key factor in determining project timelines and implementation schedules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"停电计划\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Scheduled power outage schedules used to coordinate construction and maintenance work, impacting project execution timing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"招投标管理规定\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulations governing procurement processes ensuring that all projects are subject to tendering when required.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"协议库存\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement mechanism allowing faster access to goods through pre-negotiated agreements with suppliers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电商专区交易（超市化）\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An e-commerce platform-based procurement method enabling quick and standardized purchase of common materials.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"服务框架协议采购\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement approach for services such as design, construction, and supervision, aimed at accelerating project delivery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研设计一体化招标\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement model where feasibility study and 