ion from the project reserve library and completion of feasibility study.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目调减\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Removal of projects from the annual plan due to loss of feasibility or necessity, requiring formal adjustment procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目调整\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Modification of existing project parameters such as scope, cost, or timeline, requiring re-evaluation if significant changes occur.\")##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"公司规划\"<|>\"The grid production technology renovation planning is fully integrated into the broader corporate planning system, ensuring alignment and unified management.\"<|>\"planning integration, organizational coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"总部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"Headquarters sets overall control targets and approves upper-limit projects, while divisions manage and approve lower-limit projects within their regions.\"<|>\"hierarchical governance, delegated authority\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"Divisions oversee and guide subsidiary units in project planning, budgeting, and execution, maintaining consistency across levels.\"<|>\"regional oversight, operational coordination\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for initiating and preparing feasibility studies (project proposals), which serve as prerequisites for project approval.\"<|>\"project initiation, documentation responsibility\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"Projects must obtain a feasibility study review opinion before being included in the project reserve library, ensuring readiness for implementation.\"<|>\"pre-approval requirement, project readiness\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"Annual plans and budget proposals must be composed exclusively of projects drawn from the project reserve library, ensuring only vetted projects are considered.\"<|>\"plan composition, source dependency\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"总部