    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研规模和估算\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Project feasibility study scale and estimate refers to the initial approved scope and cost baseline for a project, which should not be exceeded without re-evaluating the feasibility study.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"初步设计规模及概算\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Preliminary design scale and estimate refers to the planned scope and budget at the preliminary design stage, which must generally not exceed the approved feasibility study scale and estimate.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工图设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Construction drawing design is the detailed design phase that must be carried out after preliminary design, based on approved documents and regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计变更\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Design change refers to modifications during project implementation, requiring confirmation from design, supervision, construction, project unit, and management units, with documentation of reasons, content, and cost changes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工图文件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Final as-built drawings are prepared based on construction drawings, design change documents, and acceptance and commissioning records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目外包管理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Project outsourcing management involves legal compliance in selecting contractors, performance evaluation, dynamic monitoring, safety admission, and preventing subcontracting or irregular division.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Project unit is responsible for managing project execution, including oversight of design, construction, safety, quality, contracts, and personnel, ensuring compliance with regulations and standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"外包单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Outsourcing unit is a third-party contractor engaged in project work, subject to admission control, performance evaluation, safety management, and qualification verification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Supervision unit is responsible for overseeing construction quality, safety, progress, and cost, conducting reviews and inspections, and submitting reports according to project milestones.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Production Technology Department is involved in project approval, technical review, and participation in final acceptance for directly maintained assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Development Planning Department participates in final acceptance for direct maintenance projects and contributes to strategic planning and budget alignment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Finance and Asset Department handles financial settlement, asset transfer, and budgetary reporting related to project completion and asset turnover.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Material Management Department oversees the storage, handover, and disposal of decommissioned equipment following project implementation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全监察部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Safety Supervision Department provides authorization materials for emergency projects and ensures compliance with safety regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Extra-high voltage company is a provincial-level entity involved in identifying and authorizing emergency projects under delegated maintenance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Equipment Department receives project notifications and oversight reports for direct maintenance emergency projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全生产风险管控平台\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Safety production risk control platform is an information system used for real-name management and dynamic monitoring of field workers' safety credentials.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"四个管住\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Four controls refer to managing plans, teams, personnel, and sites at the job site, emphasizing safety management and risk control.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"三措一案\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Three measures and one plan refers to technical and safety measures and construction plans required for project execution, subject to compilation and approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备主人制\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Equipment owner system requires full-process technical supervision and enhanced control over critical steps like hidden works and high-risk operations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"作业人员准入资格核查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Work personnel entry qualification review includes checking identity, employment contracts, professional qualifications, health status, safety training, and examination results.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Emergency project refers to urgent projects initiated due to equipment failure or operational risks, implemented first then formally reported and reviewed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Company-designated accelerated implementation project is a priority initiative approved via internal sign-off and integrated into annual plans and budgets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目结算与决算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project settlement and final accounting involve reviewing engineering costs and preparing financial reports after project completion and acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备拆旧管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Equipment decommissioning management includes evaluating old equipment during feasibility studies and organizing removal and handover during project execution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"档案管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Archival management involves organizing and transferring complete project documentation within 2–3 months after commissioning, following the 'one project, one archive' principle.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目造价分析\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Project cost analysis evaluates trends in project expenses and fund utilization to improve future estimation and investment management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目后评价\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Post-project evaluation analyzes management risks and proposes improvements after a project has been in operation for some time, supporting precise and lean investment.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目