    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Corporation is the main entity responsible for managing power grid production technology transformation work, establishing regulations, and overseeing implementation across its various units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Equipment Department is the primary management department responsible for the company's power grid production technology transformation work, including policy execution, standard formulation, project approval, and supervision.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网发展部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Development Department is the centralized management department for planning and comprehensive planning, responsible for integrating technology transformation plans into overall corporate planning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Finance Department manages budgeting for technology transformation funds, oversees unified budgeting and capital transfer for assets at headquarters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网办公室\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Office is the central authority for archival management, supervising, guiding, and evaluating project documentation and organizing acceptance of project archives at headquarters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网审计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Audit Department conducts audits on headquarters-level projects and guides audit activities within divisions and subordinate units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department organizes procurement activities within the centralized procurement scope and provides guidance for project management in relevant specialties.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Dispatching Center formulates technical transformation principles for its specialty, guides project management, and directly manages planning, reserve, plan, and implementation for operated assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Division Safety and Quality Department manages production technology transformation for assets under division jurisdiction, including coordination with headquarters and oversight of inspections.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部规划统计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Division Planning and Statistics Department integrates technology transformation planning and plans into the division’s overall planning and comprehensive management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Division Finance Department manages budgeting for technology transformation funds within division assets and handles final settlement and asset transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"区域审计中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regional Audit Center conducts audits on assets managed by the division and supports audit processes across regions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Dispatching Sub-center manages professional project work and directly oversees planning, reserve, plan, and implementation for operated assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位设备管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units' Equipment Management Departments are the principal departments responsible for their respective unit’s technology transformation work, including planning, project reserves, approvals, implementation, and evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位发展部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Development Departments integrate technology transformation plans into the unit’s own planning and comprehensive management system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Finance Departments manage budgets for technology transformation funds within their units and handle final settlement and asset transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位办公室\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Offices supervise, guide, inspect, and evaluate project archive management within their respective units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Material Departments organize procurement activities within their centralized scope and 