    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A five-year cycle planning framework for power grid production technology upgrades, aligned with transmission and distribution pricing review cycles and integrated into company-wide planning management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司规划\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The overarching corporate planning system that integrates and manages grid production technology renovation planning across all levels of the organization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"总部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The central management body responsible for organizing reviews and approvals of upper-limit projects and setting overall control targets for project plans and budgets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regional divisions under the company that manage and approve lower-limit projects, organize project reviews, and handle budget decompositions within their jurisdictions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Subsidiary units or local branches responsible for compiling annual plans and budget proposals, managing project reserves, and executing project approvals within their scope.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Asset operation and maintenance units or departments responsible for proposing project demands, preparing feasibility studies, and implementing projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Feasibility study or project proposal document required for project initiation, including cost estimates and technical assessments, mandatory for projects above 200 million RMB.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"High-value projects requiring centralized review and approval by headquarters, with detailed procedures for evaluation and authorization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Lower-value projects managed and approved by regional divisions or individual units based on asset ownership and jurisdiction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A dynamic repository of pre-approved projects derived from demand, requiring feasibility study review and meeting quality and priority assessment criteria before inclusion.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家、地方、公司政策\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulatory and strategic guidelines at national, regional, and organizational levels that may necessitate mid-term adjustments or termination of equipment renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网事故\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Unexpected incidents in the power grid that trigger emergency implementation of equipment upgrades or repairs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"救灾抢修\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Emergency restoration activities following natural disasters or crises, requiring urgent execution of technical renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"迎峰度夏（冬）需求\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Seasonal peak electricity demand periods during summer and winter, influencing investment planning and project scheduling.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资采购周期\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The time required to procure materials and services, a key factor in determining project timelines and implementation schedules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"停电计划\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Scheduled power outage schedules used to coordinate construction and maintenance work, impacting project execution timing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"招投标管理规定\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Regulations governing procurement processes ensuring that all projects are subject to tendering when required.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"协议库存\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement mechanism allowing faster access to goods through pre-negotiated agreements with suppliers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电商专区交易（超市化）\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An e-commerce platform-based procurement method enabling quick and standardized purchase of common materials.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"服务框架协议采购\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement approach for services such as design, construction, and supervision, aimed at accelerating project delivery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研设计一体化招标\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A procurement model where feasibility study and design phases are combined in a single bidding process to improve efficiency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Phase of project design involving conceptual layout and technical specifications, required for projects over 200 million RMB or with complex construction needs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工图设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Detailed engineering drawings developed from approved preliminary designs, essential for actual construction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工图文件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Finalized drawings compiled after construction, incorporating changes from design revisions and field verification records.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计变更\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Modifications made during project implementation due to technical, financial, or operational reasons, requiring formal documentation and approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工程安全、质量、进度管理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Core project management responsibilities focused on ensuring compliance with safety standards, quality benchmarks, and timely delivery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工单位资质审查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Process of verifying contractor qualifications to ensure they meet legal and operational standards for project execution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Annual process involving preparation of plan and budget proposals by divisions and units based on operational needs and project reserves.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Formal release of approved project investment allocations and implementation details by headquarters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"预安排项目管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Early-stage planning activity initiated by the State Grid Equipment Department to prepare for upcoming project execution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度计划和预算调整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Process allowing modifications to project plans and budgets due to policy shifts, emergencies, or implementation challenges.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目调增\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Addition of new projects to the annual plan due to increased demand, requiring inclusion from the project reserve library and completion of feasibility study.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目调减\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Removal of projects from the annual plan due to loss of feasibility or necessity, requiring formal adjustment procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目调整\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Modification of existing project parameters such as scope, cost, or timeline, requiring re-evaluation if significant changes occur.\")##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"公司规划\"<|>\"The grid production technology renovation planning is fully integrated into the broader corporate planning system, ensuring alignment and unified management.\"<|>\"planning integration, organizational coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"总部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"Headquarters sets overall control targets and approves upper-limit projects, while divisions manage and approve lower-limit projects within their regions.\"<|>\"hierarchical governance, delegated authority\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"Divisions oversee and guide subsidiary units in project planning, budgeting, and execution, maintaining consistency across levels.\"<|>\"regional oversight, operational coordination\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for initiating and preparing feasibility studies (project proposals), which serve as prerequisites for project approval.\"<|>\"project initiation, documentation responsibility\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"Projects must obtain a feasibility study review opinion before being included in the project reserve library, ensuring readiness for implementation.\"<|>\"pre-approval requirement, project readiness\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"Annual plans and budget proposals must be composed exclusively of projects drawn from the project reserve library, ensuring only vetted projects are considered.\"<|>\"plan composition, source dependency\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"总部