    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"大型充油设备整体更换（变或进压器行部件电抗器）局部更换\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the replacement of large oil-filled equipment, including transformers and reactors, either as a whole or in part, within substation maintenance activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"组合电器敞开式断路器高压隔离开关\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves the replacement or maintenance of combined electrical equipment, specifically open-type circuit breakers and high-voltage disconnect switches.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"隔离关柜避雷器穿墙套管\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the replacement of isolation cabinets, surge arresters, and bushings used for insulation through walls in electrical systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"管站换、用电交蓄电直流电系统整体互感器及监控器增容等或更换测系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category covers the replacement or upgrading of battery systems, DC power systems, current and voltage transformers, and monitoring systems in substations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"改变造电站开关室主变室等改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the renovation or reconstruction of station switch rooms, main transformer rooms, and related facilities in power stations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电消站弧消线防圈统电抗器电容器等设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves the upgrade or replacement of arc suppression systems, line protection devices, reactors, and capacitors in power networks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"整换无功补偿器及容组交直流滤波器断路器电压\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the overall replacement of reactive power compensation equipment, capacitor banks, AC/DC filters, and associated circuit breakers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"换流阀及阀控系统更换，阀冷却系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the replacement of converter valves and their control systems, along with the cooling system for high-voltage direct current (HVDC) applications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"直改流造控制或保护泵系统更换\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves the renovation of control systems or replacement of pump systems related to DC transmission infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"输电线路杆塔更换、移位、升高\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the replacement, relocation, or elevation of transmission tower structures in overhead power lines.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"输电线 路导线地线及附属设备更 换\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category covers the replacement of conductors, ground wires, and associated accessories in transmission lines.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"换输电改电造。缆本体 更换 或 增容 改 造 ，电\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves the replacement or capacity enhancement of cable bodies, including power cable upgrades and modifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"缆配电通变道及压附器设环施网 改柜 造等 设 备 更 换改\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the renovation of cable distribution networks, including transformer, switchgear, and network cabinet replacements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"造配。电柱上开关 、电缆分 支 箱等设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the installation or replacement of pole-mounted switches, cable branch boxes, and related equipment in distribution networks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"加配装电或架空线路改 造 或迁 移 、 联络改\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves adding new distribution equipment, overhead line renovations, relocation, and network interconnection improvements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"造配、网配电网缆网及附架优件化更改换\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the optimization and replacement of distribution network cables and supporting infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度自动化机房改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category involves the renovation of dispatch automation server rooms, essential for power system monitoring and control.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电站综合自动化系统改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category refers to the modernization of integrated automation systems in substations to improve operational efficiency and data management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变 自电 动 站 装 继 置、 电保 护 备自 故 障 投 装 置 录 波及 安全 更 换及改\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This category includes the installation, replacement, and upgrading of relay protection devices, automatic fault reclosing systems, waveform recorders, and safety equipment in su