age, or critical defects requiring immediate action.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Business expansion supporting technology transformation project packages are pre-allocated funds used to meet business expansion needs such as equipment capacity upgrades and defect remediation, which are later broken down into individual projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Company-designated fast-track projects are key initiatives that must be accelerated due to changes in policy, environment, or technology, following formal decision-making procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"规章制度编号：国网（运检/2）157-2020\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The document identifier 'State Grid (Operation & Inspection/2) 157-2020' is the official regulation number for the management rules governing grid production technology transformation work.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第一章总则\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter One: General Provisions outlines the purpose, definition, scope, and applicability of the regulation, establishing foundational principles for grid production technology transformation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第二章原则和范围\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Two: Principles and Scope defines the core principles (legal compliance, precise investment, tiered responsibility) and detailed scope of eligible and excluded projects for grid technology transformation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第三章管理职责\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Three: Management Responsibilities details the roles and responsibilities of various departments and units at different levels within the State Grid Corporation regarding technology transformation management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第四章项目前期管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Four: Project Pre-management focuses on planning integration, project reserve, and alignment between planning and project initiation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department is the primary management department responsible for the company's grid production technology trans