"organization\"<|>\"Division Safety and Quality Department manages production technology transformation for assets under division jurisdiction, including coordination with headquarters and oversight of inspections.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部规划统计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Division Planning and Statistics Department integrates technology transformation planning and plans into the division’s overall planning and comprehensive management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Division Finance Department manages budgeting for technology transformation funds within division assets and handles final settlement and asset transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"区域审计中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regional Audit Center conducts audits on assets managed by the division and supports audit processes across regions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Dispatching Sub-center manages professional project work and directly oversees planning, reserve, plan, and implementation for operated assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位设备管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units' Equipment Management Departments are the principal departments responsible for their respective unit’s technology transformation work, including planning, project reserves, approvals, implementation, and evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位发展部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Development Departments integrate technology transformation plans into the unit’s own planning and comprehensive management system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Finance Departments manage budgets for technology transformation funds within their units and handle final settlement and asset transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位办公室\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Offices supervise, guide, inspect, and evaluate project archive management within their respective units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Material Departments organize procurement activities within their centralized scope and manage disposal of obsolete materials; they also support headquarters procurement and manage professional projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位审计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Units’ Audit Departments conduct audits on projects implemented within their units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Dispatching Centers manage professional project work and oversee planning, reserve, plan, and implementation for directly operated assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网经研院\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Economic Research Institute conducts feasibility reviews for limit-up projects, preliminary design reviews for directly operated assets, and provides cost analysis and post-evaluation services.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省、地市经研院（所）\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial and municipal Economic Research Institutes conduct feasibility and preliminary design reviews upon delegation from provincial or municipal companies and provide technical support such as cost analysis and post-evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造工作\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Grid production technology transformation refers to the application of mature, advanced, and applicable technologies, equipment, processes, and materials to upgrade existing grid production facilities and related auxiliary systems to enhance safety, reliability, economy, intelligence, energy efficiency, and environmental compliance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Limit-up projects include those with single investments of 20 million yuan or more for primary grid projects, 15 million yuan or more for secondary system projects, headquarters-funded projects, inter-provincial entrusted operation assets, and other major projects designated by headquarters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Limit-down projects refer to all projects that do not qualify as limit-up projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Emergency projects are initiated urgently due to natural disasters, force majeure, equipment damage, or critical defects requiring immediate action.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Business expansion supporting technology transformation project packages are pre-allocated funds used to meet business expansion needs such as equipment capacity upgrades and defect remediation, which are later broken down into individual projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Company-designated fast-track projects are key initiatives that must be accelerated due to changes in policy, environment, or technology, following formal decision-making procedures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"规章制度编号：国网（运检/2）157-2020\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The document identifier 'State Grid (Operation & Inspection/2) 157-2020' is the official regulation number for the management rules governing grid production technology transformation work.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第一章总则\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter One: General Provisions outlines the purpose, definition, scope, and applicability of the regulation, establishing foundational principles for grid production technology transformation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第二章原则和范围\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Two: Principles and Scope defines the core principles (legal compliance, precise investment, tiered responsibility) and detailed scope of eligible and excluded projects for grid technology transformation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第三章管理职责\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Three: Management Responsibilities details the roles and responsibilities of various departments and units at different levels within the State Grid Corporation regarding technology transformation management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"第四章项目前期管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Chapter Four: Project Pre-management focuses on planning integration, project reserve, and alignment between planning and project initiation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department is the primary management department responsible for the company's grid production technology transformation work.\"<|>\"organizational hierarchy, management responsibility\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网发展部\"<|>\"The State Grid Development Department integrates technology transformation planning into the company-wide strategic planning process.\"<|>\"planning integration, strategic alignment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"The State Grid Finance Department manages budgeting and capital transfer for technology transformation projects at headquarters.\"<|>\"budget control, financial management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网办公室\"<|>\"The State Grid Office supervises and evaluates project documentation practices across the organization.\"<|>\"document management, oversight\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网审计部\"<|>\"The State Grid Audit Department conducts audits on headquarters-level projects and guides auditing at lower levels.\"<|>\"audit oversight, compliance monitoring\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国网物资部\"<|>\"The State Grid Material Department organizes procurement activities and supports project management through supply chain operations.\"<|>\"procurement management, supply chain\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"The State Grid Dispatching Center manages technical transformation projects within its operational domain and sets professional guidelines.\"<|>\"operational management, technical leadership\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"分部安质部\"<|>\"The Division Safety and Quality Department manages local assets and coordinates with headquarters on transformation projects.\"<|>\"regional management, coordination\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"各单位设备管理部门\"<|>\"Each unit's Equipment Management Department is responsible for executing transformation projects within its jurisdiction.\"<|>\"decentralized implementation, operational responsibility\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department is responsible for approving feasibility studies for limit-up projects.\"<|>\"project approval, governance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department supervises and guides the management of limit-down projects across the organization.\"<|>\"oversight, management guidance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department oversees emergency projects through its broader project management framework.\"<|>\"emergency response, project oversight\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department may influence the deployment and utilization of business expansion project packages.\"<|>\"project funding, infrastructure support\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department plays a role in expediting approved priority projects.\"<|>\"accelerated implementation, strategic execution\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网经研院\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Economic Research Institute conducts feasibility reviews for limit-up projects.\"<|>\"technical review, project evaluation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省、地市经研院（所）\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"Provincial and municipal economic research institutes conduct feasibility and preliminary design reviews for projects delegated by higher authorities.\"<|>\"technical support, delegated review\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网发展部\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造工作\"<|>\"The State Grid Development Department integrates the overall planning of technology transformation projects into the company's strategic and comprehensive planning.\"<|>\"strategic planning, integration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造工作\"<|>\"The State Grid Finance Department manages the budgeting and financial lifecycle of technology transformation projects.\"<|>\"financial management, capital allocation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网办公室\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造工作\"<|>\"The State Grid Offic