e technical support for project evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网一次设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Grid primary equipment refers to fundamental physical infrastructure such as transmission lines, transformers, circuit breakers, and switchgear that form the core of the power grid.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电站自动化系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Substation automation systems are integrated control and monitoring systems used to automate operations in substations, enhancing reliability and operational efficiency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度自动化系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Dispatching automation systems are digital platforms used for real-time monitoring, control, and data processing in power dispatching centers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护及安全自动装置\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Relay protection and safety automatic devices are critical systems designed to detect faults and automatically isolate damaged components to prevent cascading failures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力通信系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Power communication systems enable reliable data transmission between grid control centers, substations, and field devices, supporting automation and monitoring functions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自动控制设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Automatic control equipment refers to devices used to regulate and monitor grid parameters such as voltage, frequency, and load distribution without manual intervention.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产建筑物、构筑物\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Grid production buildings and structures include facilities such as control rooms, substations, warehouses, and auxiliary buildings essential for grid operation and maintenance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全技术劳动保护设施\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Safety and labor protection facilities are infrastructure and equipment installed to ensure worker safety and compliance with occupational health standards during grid operations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"非贸易结算电能计量装置\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Non-trading metering devices are electricity meters used for internal monitoring and performance evaluation rather than 