(\"relationship\"<|>\"停电计划\"<|>\"项目里程碑计划\"<|>\"Power outage schedules are integrated into milestone plans to time construction and maintenance activities with planned system shutdowns.\"|>\"scheduling alignment, operational coordination\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"物资采购周期\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"Procurement timelines directly affect project procurement strategies, influencing whether protocols like agreement inventory or e-commerce transactions are used.\"|>\"procurement strategy, time sensitivity\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目调增\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"All project increases must originate from the project reserve library and have completed feasibility study approval before being added to the annual plan.\"|>\"project expansion, reserve dependency\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目调减\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"Projects removed from the plan must have previously been part of the reserve library and now lack implementation viability.\"|>\"project withdrawal, lifecycle management\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目调整\"<|>\"可研批复\"<|>\"When project adjustments involve major financial changes, the feasibility study approval must be re-performed to validate updated parameters.\"|>\"revalidation requirement, procedural compliance\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"业主项目部\"<|>\"项目经理\"<|>\"The owner project department appoints the project manager to lead the execution of outsourced projects and oversee daily operations.\"|>\"organizational structure, leadership assignment\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"业主项目部\"<|>\"安全、质量等相关管理人员\"<|>\"The owner project department includes dedicated personnel responsible for safety and quality control, ensuring compliance throughout the project lifecycle.\"|>\"oversight role, compliance management\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目管理团队\"<|>\"项目负责人\"<|>\"The project management team is led by the project leader, who coordinates all aspects of self-implemented projects.\"|>\"team leadership, internal management\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目管理团队\"<|>\"施工作业班组（团队）\"<|>\"The project management team organizes and supervises the construction operation team during the implementation phase.\"|>\"supervision, task delegation\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"竣工图编制\"<|>\"项目设计管理\"<|>\"Final drawing preparation is a required phase within project design management, ensuring accurate documentation of completed works.\"|>\"documentation phase, design completeness\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"协议库存\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"Agreement inventory is a procurement method used to accelerate material delivery, supporting efficient project execution.\"|>\"procurement acceleration, supply chain optimization\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电商专区交易（超市化）\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"E-commerce special zone transactions enable fast, standardized procurement, reducing delays in project implementation.\"|>\"digital procurement, speed enhancement\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"服务框架协议采购\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"Framework agreements for services help streamline the hiring of design, construction, and supervision teams, speeding up project start.\"|>\"service procurement, efficiency gain\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可研、设计一体化招标\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"Integrated bidding for feasibility study and design reduces overlap and accelerates the project initiation phase.\"|>\"process integration, time saving\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"原设计单位\"<|>\"项目设计\"<|>\"The original design unit may be commissioned to continue design work to maintain consistency and compatibility with existing systems.\"|>\"design continuity, technical coherence\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工图设计\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Construction drawing design follows preliminary design, using its outputs as a basis for detailed engineering work.\"|>\"design progression, technical development\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"初步设计审查\"<|>\"可研报告\"<|>\"Preliminary design review is based on the approved feasibility study report, ensuring alignment between conceptual and detailed plans.\"|>\"review linkage, plan consistency\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可研批复\"<|>\"立项程序\"<|>\"Feasibility study approval is a prerequisite for initiating the formal project establishment process, confirming project viability.\"|>\"approval gateway, legal initiation\"|>10)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度预算投入规模\"<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"The annual budget allocation must match the approved project list and timeline, ensuring financial alignment with operational plans.\"|>\"budget-execution alignment, fiscal control\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"预安排项目\"<|>\"迎峰度夏（冬）需求\"<|>\"Pre-arranged projects are specifically designed to address seasonal peak load demands, ensuring grid stability during high-use periods.\"|>\"seasonal preparedness, demand response\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"公司总部下达总控目标\"<|>\"Emergency projects may be fast-tracked even if they fall outside the initial total control target, requiring special approval from the company headquarters.\"|>\"exception handling, executive override\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司指定加快实施项目\"<|>\"公司总部下达总控目标\"<|>\"Projects designated for fast-tracking by the company headquarters are prioritized regardless of initial planning constraints, requiring direct executive authorization.\"|>\"executive priority, strategic focus\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"未分解的项目明细\"<|>\"项目替换\"<|>\"Unallocated project details can only be replaced after undergoing the division’s decision-making process, ensuring transparency and control.\"|>\"change governance, procedural integrity\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度计划和预算调整\"<|>\"谁下达、谁调整\"<|>\"The principle of 'who approves, adjusts' ensures that only authorized levels can modify plans, maintaining accountability and control.\"|>\"governance principle, responsibility alignment\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"管理权限\"<|>\"计划和预算调整程序\"<|>\"The level of management authority determines which entity can initiate or approve adjustments to project plans and budgets.\"|>\"decision-making hierarchy, procedural control\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"资金重大调整\"<|>\"重新履行可研审批程序\"<|>\"Significant financial changes require the feasibility study to be re-approved to ensure updated economic and technical validity.\"|>\"revalidation necessity, risk control\"|>10)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"招标采购因素\"<|>\"计划调整程序\"<|>\"Changes in procurement outcomes that exceed 15% of the original investment trigger the need for a formal plan adjustment, even without re-reviewing the feasibility study.\"|>\"procurement impact, procedural threshold\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设备技术鉴定及处置意见\"<|>\"可研报告\"<|>\"The technical assessment and disposal recommendation for decommissioned equipment must be included in the feasibility study report for completeness.\"|>\"document integration, technical documentation\"|>9)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"拟拆除设备\"<|>\"设备技术鉴定及处置意见\"<|>\"The identification of equipment slated for removal triggers the need for a technical evaluation and disposal plan, forming part of the project documentation.\"|>\"asset decommissioning, pre-planning\"|>8)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目前期发生的可行性研究等费用支出\"<|>\"年度预算管理\"<|>\"Costs incurred during project pre-phase activities can be included in the annual budget, allowing financial tracking and accountability.\"|>\"pre-project financing, budget inclusion\"|>7)##  \n(\"relationship\"<|>\"评审意见出具时间超过3年\"<|>\"项目储备库\"<|>\"Projects with outdated feasibility reviews must be removed from the reserve library unless they are re-evaluated and re-entered through formal procedures.\"|>\"reservoir maintenance, time-based eligibility\"|>9)##  \n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project lifecycle management, feasibility and design integration, procurement optimization, emergency response, budget and planning control, governance and authority, seasonal demand planning, compliance and documentation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
